<title>USA: Net Lnnx sees Q3 EPS $0.30 before taxes.</title>
<headline>Net Lnnx sees Q3 EPS $0.30 before taxes.</headline>
<dateline>WEST PALM BEACH, Fla. 1996-09-09</dateline>
<text>
<p>Net Lnnx Inc said on Monday that it expects earnings before taxes for the third quarter ending September 30 to be about $0.30 per share.  </p>
<p>The company said it expects earnings before income taxes during the third quarter to exceed the total start up costs incurred in connection with its wholly owned Internet subsidiary, TrueNet Corp, since its inception.</p>
